 been shivering the whole time, haven't you? Are YOU scared of the dark?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NZ75","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"NZ75","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Y-you're kidding, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"P90","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"P90","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shhh— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We're here."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"NZ75 and CZ75 come to a halt and lift their heads—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"21Jashin_testroom","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"NZ75＆CZ75","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Isn't this the Sangvis-only isolated exam room?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Inside the exam room."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NZ75","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Boss","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"NZ75","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This isn't good, right? Miss Kalina's going to punish us really hard if we barge into the PA Sector without permission! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Also, didn't MDR's paranormal activity channel say something about this place being haunted at night?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CZ75","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"CZ75","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are you getting at? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's not too late to back out now if you want to give up on our duel."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"P90","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[